<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9378" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντᾰγων-ίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>struggle against, prove a match for,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί,</span> esp. in war, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ταῖς παρασκεναῖς τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					43.81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς βαρβάρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					17.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
				12.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>struggle, vie with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					4.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀνταγωνιζόμενοί τι</span>”
				<i>the parties in a lawsuit,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.2.27
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐλευθέριοι] οὐκ ἀ. περὶ τῶν
					χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1366b8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>act a part in rivalry with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be set against,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					10.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
